930 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 2115 0 R
/T (Answer: Traditional relays use rigid thresholds and fail during complex transients in modern grids. Deep Learning captures the actual "shape" of faults, solving protection gaps traditional relays cannot. )
/E (Answer: Traditional relays use rigid thresholds and fail during complex transients in modern grids. Deep Learning captures the actual "shape" of faults, solving protection gaps traditional relays cannot. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
